        "original_id": "f3fc8d12-c324-5c14-9e03-08c679824ed2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Magazines: Guitar World, Golf Digest\n- Companies: Condé Nast Publications, The New York Times Company\n- People: Daron Malakian\n- Places: United States, Des Moines, Iowa\n- Topics: guitar, golf, magazine publishing, rankings\n\nFacts:\n- Golf Digest started in 1950.\n- Golf Digest was sold to The New York Times Company in 1969.\n- Guitar World has been published since July 1980.\n- Golf Digest is a monthly golf magazine published by Condé Nast Publications in the United States.\n- Guitar World is a monthly music magazine devoted to guitarists.\n- Golf Digest is headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa.\n- Daron Malakian was placed 30th in Guitar World's list The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.",
